                "loc": "NUM.21.21+NUM.21.22+NUM.21.23+NUM.21.24+NUM.21.25+NUM.21.26+NUM.21.27+NUM.21.28+NUM.21.29+NUM.21.30+NUM.21.31+NUM.21.32+NUM.21.33+NUM.21.34+NUM.21.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hen 21.21-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Qab-Ser 2.26—3.11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Israeli yayu qara lafa Yordanini ilaboru, ta haga bale Arnoniti ejite bale Yordanitifi haga gaara Hermoni gara mirgati ejitu dabsate fud'ate keesa qubate. Worri hayyoota lama dabsate, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "toko Sihoni, hayyu Amori, ka dira Heshboni tau. Lafti inni fide Gilgali gama toko: Haga Aroeri (afaani bale Arnoni) ammalle dira bale suni wod'aka jiru ejite, haga galaana Yaboki seera Amoniti ejiti: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle baleeni Yordani haga galaana Galilaya bita, haga Beth-Yeshimoni (galaana sooda ilaboru) haga golba gaara Pisgati ejite.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri hayyu Ogulle, ka dira Bashani, ka worra Refeni ka hafe keesaa d'alatele, dabsate: inni dira Ashtarothifi Edari keesa tae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafti inni fide gaara Hermonifi Saleka, lafa Bashani, haga seera Geshurifi Maaka, ammalle lafa Gileadi gama toko, haga lafa Heshboni, ta hayyu Sioni fiduti ejiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.32.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hen 32.33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.3.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Qab-Ser 3.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayyoota lamaani tana Musafi worra Israeliti dabsate. Hojattuuni AABBO Waaqa Musani lafa hayyoota suni gosa Reubenitifi ta Gaditifi ta Manase ta haga gariti kenne, aka worri lafa suni d'aalu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hayyoota Yoshuani dabsate",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshuafi worri Israeli hayyoota ch'ufa ta lafa Yordani ila aduu, haga Baal-Gadi Lebanoni keesaa fuud'e gaara Halaki ka bita d'aatu lafa Edomuti, d'aabe ch'ufa dabsate. Inni lafa tana worra Israeliti gosa gosani gargari qoodeefi akanaani lafti sunini ta worraa taate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoodi suni lafa gaareeni, lafa ila aduu ta golba gaara, bale Yordanitifi golba isii, gooro ilaboru ammalle lafa gamooji ta bita. Duri lafa tana ch'ufa worra Hitifa, Amorifa Kanaanifa, Perizifa, Hivifa ammalle Yebusifaati taa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Israeli hayyoota dira kana dabsate: Yeriko, Ai (d'aatu Betheli), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yerusalemu, Hebroni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yarmuthi, Lakishi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egloni, Gezeri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Debiri, Gederi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Horma, Aradi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Libna, Adulamu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makeda, Betheli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tapua, Heferi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afeka, Lasharoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Madoni, Hazori, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shimron-Meroni, Akshafu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Taanaki, Megido, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kedeshi, Yokneamu (Kameli keesa), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dori (afaani Baariini Galilaya keesa) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ammalle Tirsa — hayyooti tunini ch'ufti sodomi toko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
